/div></details><?php endforeach; ?></div></section>

<section class="single-herbs-guide__section" aria-labelledby="topic-six-formulas-title"><h4 id="topic-six-formulas-title"><?php echo s($toxintext('When the herb leads the formula', 'Cuando la hierba dirige la fórmula')); ?></h4><p class="single-herbs-guide__section-lead"><?php echo s($toxintext('Only chief or co-chief connections within the current 63-formula Board roster appear here.', 'Aquí aparecen solamente relaciones principales o coprincipales dentro del listado Board vigente de 63 fórmulas.')); ?></p><div class="single-herbs-guide__formula-leads"><article class="single-herbs-guide__formula-lead"><h5>Jin Yin Hua + Lian Qiao</h5><p><strong>Yin Qiao San:</strong> <?php echo s($toxintext('co-chief pair that disperses Wind-Heat and clears early Heat-toxin from the Lung and throat.', 'pareja coprincipal que dispersa Viento-Calor y aclara Calor-Toxina temprano de Pulmón y garganta.')); ?></p></article></div><p class="single-herbs-guide__scope-note"><strong><?php echo s($toxintext('Roster boundary:', 'Límite del listado:')); ?></strong> <?php echo s($toxintext('No additional formula is shown because the other familiar toxicity formulas are outside the current 63-formula Domain list.', 'No se muestra otra fórmula porque las demás fórmulas conocidas para toxicidad están fuera del listado vigente de 63 fórmulas del Domain.')); ?></p></section>

